<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLAND 0 ITALY 1 - LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLAND 0 ITALY 1 - LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy led England 1-0 in their World Cup European group two qualifying match at Wembley on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Gianfranco Zola 19.</p>
